[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m That is the **full set of public entry points, one entry point, and it is also
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m the lowest-level one** — there is no convenience wrapper layer above it and no
