[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    272[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // Harness sanity: confirm the captured stream is the real thing and not
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    273[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // (say) two identically-empty captures. The C remains ground truth — if
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    274[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // this ever fired, the model would be what is wrong.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    275[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     assert_eq!(
